# Who must review changes to the parts of this repo that run on everyone's laptop.
#
# Why: every teammate's scheduler runs the code in .houston/ unattended, and runs follow the
# setup and skills/. Anyone who can push here unreviewed can run code on every teammate's
# laptop through their runs.
#
# To use it:
# 1. Rename this file to CODEOWNERS and replace @your-org/leads with your leads (a team or usernames).
# 2. Turn on protection for these paths so changes need a reviewed pull request: in the repo's
#    Settings → Rules, add a ruleset that restricts pushes touching them, with your leads allowed
#    to bypass, and require review from Code Owners on pull requests.
#    Don't require pull requests for the whole default branch: runs push pages and day logs to it
#    directly, and would be refused.

/.houston/     @your-org/leads
/houston.yml   @your-org/leads
/cadences/     @your-org/leads
/skills/       @your-org/leads
